"only add data about players you actually coach, and you're responsible for having the right to hold it (a guardian's consent, especially for a minor — see": "añade solo datos de jugadores que entrenes realmente, y eres responsable de tener derecho a conservarlos (el consentimiento de un tutor, sobre todo si es menor — consulta",
